  Lines:
  - ClipId: sys_recovery_1
    Subtitle: '[TEMPORAL RECOVERY] Employee death reversed. Please return to work.'
  - ClipId: sys_recovery_2
    Subtitle: '[TEMPORAL RECOVERY] Death reversed. Please try to die less.'
  - ClipId: sys_recovery_3
    Subtitle: '[TEMPORAL RECOVERY] This is your third death tonight. A note has been added to your file.'
  - ClipId: sys_recovery_4
    Subtitle: '[TEMPORAL RECOVERY] Your deaths are now being deducted from your annual leave.'
  - ClipId: sys_recovery_5
    Subtitle: '[TEMPORAL RECOVERY] Death reversed. Again.'
  TierNotes:
  - 
  - It felt that.
  - It remembers where you died.
  - It knows where you are going.
  - It remembers everything.
  Delay: 1.1
